  "text": "Platinum Price in the 1990s\nBetween the first (1990-04-30) and last (1999-12-30) monthly observations available for the 1990s, the LBMA platinum price went from $469 to $443 — a decline of 5% — with a sampled high of $490 (May 1990) and a sampled low of $332 (Dec 1991).\nYears in the 1990s\n1990\n1991\n1992\n1993\n1994\n1995\n1996\n1997\n1998\n1999\nSee today's live platinum price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop platinum bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
